---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Legionella Risk Assessment Edinburgh | Scotland EPC"
  description="Arrange a Legionella risk assessment in Edinburgh with Scotland EPC. Reliable support for landlords and letting agents with straightforward booking."
  canonicalPath="/legionella-risk-assessment-edinburgh"
>
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container-pro max-w-4xl space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Legionella Risk Assessments in Edinburgh</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-700">Scotland EPC provides Edinburgh Legionella risk assessments for landlords and agents who want clear documentation and a dependable service experience.</p>
      <div class="quote-card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Why clients book this service</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
          <li>To review risk controls between tenancies.</li>
          <li>To support day-to-day rental property management.</li>
          <li>To combine with EPC assessments in one visit where practical.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-700">Get started from the <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/#quote">homepage quote section</a> and include your postcode for fast pricing.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-700">Related pages: <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/epc-edinburgh">EPC assessments in Edinburgh</a>, <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/legionella-risk-assessment-glasgow">Legionella risk assessments in Glasgow</a>, and the <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/">main Scotland EPC homepage</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
